{"channelId":"UCYwDsHiV2NClULcVRuoRuoQ","row":["Tv for dogs, brought to you by Doggy Woods Retreat",53200,"TV for Dogs – Real Pack Life from Doggy Woods Retreat\n\nWelcome to Doggy Woods Retreat — your pup’s new favorite network for DogTV-style videos filmed around the world.\n\nWe create TV for dogs: long, calming videos that entertain and comfort pups who are home alone, anxious, or just love watching other dogs.\n\nThese are real-life pack walks, forest adventures, and social time from our dog boarding and daycare business and friends around the world — not artificial loops or stock clips.\n\nIf your dog gets anxious, bored, or just loves watching other dogs… this is the real DogTV alternative they’ll love.\n\nJosh, Colette, Eve, and our friends are proud to share real dogs playing, exploring, and relaxing together.\n\nLeave a comment with your dog's name written in phonetic English so I can pronounce it correctly!\n\nDogTV worldwide:\n🇯🇵 日本の犬向け DogTV  \n🇪🇸 DogTV para perros  \n🇧🇷 DogTV para cães  \n🇩🇪 DogTV für Hunde  \n🇫🇷 DogTV pour chiens  \n🇰🇷 강아지 DogTV  \n🇹🇼 狗狗 DogTV  \n🇮🇳 कुत्तों के लिए DogTV","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYwDsHiV2NClULcVRuoRuoQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYwDsHiV2NClULcVRuoRuoQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:05.148Z","channelId":"UCYwDsHiV2NClULcVRuoRuoQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"8bfa9a8fe939c95c261f9a3ce65a28d9520ecc61b3efdccc71fd9917d862b705","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"7579240dab0ed7adf2a39d8f7f92796d6c8f128d7672d9c5f6b4c3f9cd84a1e2"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYwDsHiV2NClULcVRuoRuoQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:05.148Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYwDsHiV2NClULcVRuoRuoQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":53200,"raw":"53.2K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYwDsHiV2NClULcV